1. Set up your Canva page
Step 1 — Create the document
Open Canva and click Create a design → Custom size.
Set the units to mm.
Enter 297 mm wide × 420 mm high (A3 portrait).
Create a blank design.
Set the page background to warm ivory #F4F0E6.
Step 2 — Establish the newspaper palette
Use these colours consistently:
Paper
