Step 3 — Choose your fonts
Search for these in Canva:
Masthead: Bodoni Moda Black or Playfair Display ExtraBold
Main headline: Anton or League Spartan
Article headings: Libre Baskerville Bold
Article text and labels: Roboto or Source Sans 3
Use no more than three font families. The serif masthead gives it newspaper credibility; the bold sans-serif headline creates the dramatic space-news look.
